Why?
For an SQS-triggered Lambda, Lambda needs permissions such as:
- sqs:ReceiveMessage
- sqs:DeleteMessage
- sqs:GetQueueAttributes
The AWS managed policy provides the required permissions for the basic SQS event-source integration.
